=== RETURN ===
- returning game state (i.e. target hit, end of match, result of debugs), the only word (1x32 bit) sent
- requires server is listening over serial
|---------------------------------------------------|
00 00 00 00   __ __ __ __   __ __ __ __   __ __ __ __
|---| |---|
PROTOCOL ID
- 0x0000 = general
- 0x0001 = target
- 0x0002 = lighting
- 0x0110 = return (you are here)
      |---|
      MODE
      - 0x0000 = idle
      - 0x0001 = (acknowledgement of) target reset (bring servos to 0°)
      - 0x0010 = (acknowledgement of) run game (or round is active)
      - 0x0011 = (acknowledgement of) run debug (optional target defined on [0x0101,0x1000])
      - 0x0100 = target hit 
      - 0x0101 = end of game signal
      - 0x1001 = to stdout (for debugging)
      - 0x1010 = error

__ __ __ __   00 00 00 00   __ __ __ __   __ __ __ __
              |---| ↑↑ ↑↑
              TARGET ID
              - 0-11 [0x0000, 0x1011] for each target (12)
              - 15 (0x1111) = controller itself
                    || ||
                    STATUS
                    - 00 = idle
                    - 01 = hit
                    - 02 = stuck
                    - 03 = lost connectivity to target / not found
                    - 04 = lost connectivity to server

__ __ __ __   __ __ __ __   00 00 00 00   00 00 00 00
                            |-----------------------|
                            RESERVED